{"id":"1f140d586b55a13f","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-index-operator.md","title":"Index of an Operator","display":"df-index-operator — Index of an Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-index-operator","aliases":["58-df-index-operator"],"display":"df-index-operator — Index of an Operator","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-index-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-index-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-index-operator — Index of an Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3600401d4adbcbd4\" href=\"?note=3600401d4adbcbd4\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,H^+,H^-\\in V\">\\(k,H^+,H^-\\in V\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^+,H^-\">\\(H^+,H^-\\)</span> 为 Banach 空间）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:H^+\\to H^-\">\\(P:H^+\\to H^-\\)</span>（有界线性算子）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ker P\">\\(\\ker P\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}P\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}P\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{coker}P\\coloneqq H^-/\\operatorname{ran}P\">\\(\\operatorname{coker}P\\coloneqq H^-/\\operatorname{ran}P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_-\">\\(\\tau_-\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^-\">\\(H^-\\)</span> 的范数拓扑）与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}_S(\\operatorname{ran}P,H^-,\\tau_-)\">\\(\\operatorname{Closed}_S(\\operatorname{ran}P,H^-,\\tau_-)\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3600401d4adbcbd4\" href=\"?note=3600401d4adbcbd4\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fredholm}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Fredholm}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（此处定义的 Fredholm 谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S\\)</span>（有界算子谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FredholmIndex}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{FredholmIndex}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（Fredholm 指标值关系）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fredholm\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fredholm}_S(P,H^+,H^-,\\tau_-)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(P,H^+,H^-)\\land\\operatorname{Closed}_S(\\operatorname{ran}P,H^-,\\tau_-)\\land\\dim\\ker P&lt;\\omega\\land\\dim\\operatorname{coker}P&lt;\\omega\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fredholm\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fredholm}_S(P,H^+,H^-,\\tau_-)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(P,H^+,H^-)\\land\\operatorname{Closed}_S(\\operatorname{ran}P,H^-,\\tau_-)\\land\\dim\\ker P&lt;\\omega\\land\\dim\\operatorname{coker}P&lt;\\omega\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FredholmIndex}_S(k,P,H^+,H^-,\\tau_-)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Fredholm}_S(P,H^+,H^-,\\tau_-)\n\\land k\\in\\mathbb Z\n\\land k=\\dim\\ker P-\\dim\\operatorname{coker}P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FredholmIndex}_S(k,P,H^+,H^-,\\tau_-)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Fredholm}_S(P,H^+,H^-,\\tau_-)\n\\land k\\in\\mathbb Z\n\\land k=\\dim\\ker P-\\dim\\operatorname{coker}P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>可复合 Fredholm 算子满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ind}(QP)=\\operatorname{ind}(Q)+\\operatorname{ind}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{ind}(QP)=\\operatorname{ind}(Q)+\\operatorname{ind}(P)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>指标在 Fredholm 算子的算子范数连续路径上不变。</li>\n<li>同一 Hilbert 空间上的自伴 Fredholm 算子因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{coker}P\\cong\\ker P^*\">\\(\\operatorname{coker}P\\cong\\ker P^*\\)</span> 而指标为零。</li>\n<li>椭圆算子在闭流形上的适当 Sobolev 实现是 Fredholm；Atiyah–Singer 定理计算其指标。</li>\n<li>“抛物型自动使指标为零”不是一般事实，已删除。</li>\n<li>闭值域条件采用拓扑闭集谓词的完整三元签名；旧式二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Closed}_S\\)</span> 没有对应的上游定义。</li>\n<li>指标只对 Fredholm 算子定义，故改成带输出整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的值关系；这避免在非 Fredholm 算子上留下无守卫的部分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ind}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{ind}(P)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"3600401d4adbcbd4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"3600401d4adbcbd4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_-$（$H^-$ 的范数拓扑）与 $\\operatorname{Closed}_S(\\operatorname{ran}P,H^-,\\tau_-)$（见 [[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S$（有界算子谓词，见 [[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,H^+,H^-\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"H^+,H^-","display":false},{"tex":"P:H^+\\to H^-","display":false},{"tex":"\\ker P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{coker}P\\coloneqq H^-/\\operatorname{ran}P","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_-","display":false},{"tex":"H^-","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Closed}_S(\\operatorname{ran}P,H^-,\\tau_-)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fredholm}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FredholmIndex}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fredholm\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fredholm}_S(P,H^+,H^-,\\tau_-)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(P,H^+,H^-)\\land\\operatorname{Closed}_S(\\operatorname{ran}P,H^-,\\tau_-)\\land\\dim\\ker P<\\omega\\land\\dim\\operatorname{coker}P<\\omega","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FredholmIndex}_S(k,P,H^+,H^-,\\tau_-)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Fredholm}_S(P,H^+,H^-,\\tau_-)\n\\land k\\in\\mathbb Z\n\\land k=\\dim\\ker P-\\dim\\operatorname{coker}P.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ind}(QP)=\\operatorname{ind}(Q)+\\operatorname{ind}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{coker}P\\cong\\ker P^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Closed}_S","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ind}(P)","display":false}],"bytes":2209,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-669","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-index-operator.md|58-df-index-operator]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["2ad9c248fe18df37","3600401d4adbcbd4"]}